{
  "id": "node-card:concept__physical-change",
  "node_id": "concept:physical-change",
  "card_layer": "backbone",
  "title": "物理变化",
  "pattern_refs": ["pattern:concept-core-v2"],
  "summary": "物质发生形态或形状变化但不生成新物质的变化，是物质变化的基本类型之一。",
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "definition",
      "title": "定义",
      "section_type": "definition",
      "content": [
        "物质发生形态或形状的变化，但没有生成其他物质，这样的变化属于物理变化"
      ],
      "source_refs": ["evidence:chem-grade8-all-in-one:1-1-1:physical-change"]
    },
    {
      "id": "essence",
      "title": "本质理解",
      "section_type": "essence",
      "content": [
        "物理变化的特点是没有新物质生成",
        "物理变化只是物质形态或状态的改变"
      ],
      "source_refs": ["evidence:chem-grade8-all-in-one:1-1-1:physical-change"]
    },
    {
      "id": "key-points",
      "title": "核心要点",
      "section_type": "key_points",
      "content": [
        "判断物理变化的关键：没有生成新物质",
        "物理变化只是物质状态或形态的改变，如固态变液态、形状改变等"
      ],
      "source_refs": ["evidence:chem-grade8-all-in-one:1-1-1:physical-change"]
    },
    {
      "id": "examples",
      "title": "典型例子",
      "section_type": "example",
      "content": [
        "水沸腾：液态的水经沸腾变为水蒸气，冷凝后又变回液态的水",
        "镁带剪断：镁带被分成小段，只是形状改变"
      ],
      "source_refs": ["evidence:chem-grade8-all-in-one:1-1-1:physical-change", "evidence:chem-grade8-all-in-one:1-1-1:water-boiling"]
    },
    {
      "id": "misconceptions",
      "title": "易混辨析",
      "section_type": "misconception",
      "content": [
        "物理变化与化学变化的区别：物理变化没有新物质生成，化学变化有新物质生成",
        "发光、放热等现象不一定都是化学变化，需要判断是否有新物质生成"
      ],
      "source_refs": ["evidence:chem-grade8-all-in-one:1-1-1:physical-change", "evidence:chem-grade8-all-in-one:1-1-1:chemical-change-phenomena"]
    }
  ],
  "source_refs": ["evidence:chem-grade8-all-in-one:1-1-1:physical-change"],
